	(text "V_{OVC} = 16.1  V (Default: Configurable through registers) \nI_{LIM} = 7A R_{ILM} = 1.54k (over current protection circuit breaker threshold) (Start-Up)\nR_{IMON} = 3.65k: I_{OCP} = V_{IREF} / (18.18 uA/A * R_{IMON}) = 15 A at default V_{IREF} = 1.0 V\nFast-trip = 2 * I_{OCP} = 30 A (default)\nV_{IN(UV)} = V_{PG} = 4.8 * (R_{TOP} + R_{BOT}) / R_{BOT} = 12V\nV_{IN} = 12V, R_{OUT} = 500 Ohms, C_{OUT} = 1 mF \nC_{DVDT} = 22nF (DEVICE_CONFIG[10:9] adjusts SR)"
